The sign of the loop. Pilot runs of `material_balance` on the 20-sector Eurostat 2020 substrate with an effective delay of two quarters, a 40 per cent capacity shock to sector `c12`, and three seeds, varying the gain with which output targets are revised in response to the observed shortage. Mean and peak shortage rise and welfare falls from the first increment: the plan-revision loop is positive, and Corollary [[REF:cor:posloop]] says no positive gain can be stabilising. Source: the calibration record in `docs/AMENDMENTS.md`, Amendment 1.
